@base = http://localhost:6543

### Home
GET {{base}}/

### Mahasiswa - list
GET {{base}}/api/mahasiswa

### Mahasiswa - detail
GET {{base}}/api/mahasiswa/1

### Mahasiswa - create
POST {{base}}/api/mahasiswa
Content-Type: application/json

{"nim":"99901","nama":"Praktikan Uji","jurusan":"Teknik Informatika","tanggal_lahir":"2003-01-01","alamat":"Lampung"}

### Mahasiswa - update
PUT {{base}}/api/mahasiswa/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"jurusan":"Teknik Informatika"}

### Mahasiswa - delete
DELETE {{base}}/api/mahasiswa/99901

### Matakuliah - list
GET {{base}}/api/matakuliah

### Matakuliah - detail
GET {{base}}/api/matakuliah/1

### Matakuliah - create
POST {{base}}/api/matakuliah
Content-Type: application/json

{"kode_mk":"IF9999","nama_mk":"Uji API","sks":3,"semester":5}

### Matakuliah - update
PUT {{base}}/api/matakuliah/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"sks":4}

### Matakuliah - delete
DELETE {{base}}/api/matakuliah/999

### Matakuliah - invalid required fields (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/api/matakuliah
Content-Type: application/json

{"kode_mk":"IF8888"}

### Matakuliah - missing ID (expect 404)
GET {{base}}/api/matakuliah/99999
